message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "EWF Tech Simulator"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A modular Python simulation of the Earth, Wind & Fire (EWF) ventilation system,
  designed for Rhino 8 and Grasshopper. It estimates yearly electricity use from
  hourly weather and occupancy data.
